<title>USA: Green Oasis process qualifies for credits.</title>
<headline>Green Oasis process qualifies for credits.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLESTON, S.C. 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Green Oasis Environmental Inc said on Monday that its process for converting waste oil into marketable fuels meets the qualifications for producing a liquid synthetic fuel under the Internal Revenue Code and is entitled to the credits available under Section 29(a).</p>
<p>The company said these tax credits amount to about $0.137 per gallon, or $5.76 per barrel of oil equivalent.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
